OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are students put off studying
OL,4,Alanguages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn academic says young people are being
OL,7,Fput off studying foreign languages
OL,8,Fbecause they are not aware of the
OL,9,Fcareer options they lead to.
OL,11,FThere has been a long-term fall in the
OL,12,Fnumbers studying modern languages at
OL,13,Fschool, raising concern that youngsters
OL,14,Fwill miss out on work and cultural
OL,15,Fopportunities.
OL,17,FNewcastle University has been holding
OL,18,Fan event to promote the benefits of
OL,19,Fmultilingualism.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
