OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are students put off studying
OL,4,Alanguages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of students taking a
OL,7,Flanguage at GCSE has fallen from more
OL,8,Fthan 550,000 before 2004 to just over
OL,9,F370,000 in 2024, according to analysis
OL,10,Ffrom the University of Leeds.
